---
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="shell">
    <p class="eyebrow rise" style="--delay: 0ms">SV2TTS &middot; Nepali &middot; 10 speakers</p>

    <h1 class="rise" style="--delay: 70ms">
      Clone a voice<br />
      <em>speaking Nepali</em><br />
      from five seconds of audio.
    </h1>

    <div class="lede rise" style="--delay: 160ms">
      <p>
        A three-stage neural pipeline that learns a speaker&rsquo;s timbre from one short
        reference clip, then reads arbitrary Nepali text back in that voice &mdash; without
        ever being trained on the speaker.
      </p>
      <p class="sub">
        Built on the SV2TTS architecture and adapted to a low-resource language. The
        model server runs on two CPU cores, so everything you hear is synthesised live.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="facts rise" style="--delay: 240ms">
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Reference needed</dt><dd>~5<span>s</span></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Speaker embedding</dt><dd>256<span>-d</span></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Output rate</dt><dd>16<span>kHz</span></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Trained on speaker</dt><dd>No<span>, zero-shot</span></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <p class="jump rise" style="--delay: 320ms">
      <a href="#studio">Try it &darr;</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.5rem) clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); }

  h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-4);
    margin-block: 0.7em 0;
    max-width: 16ch;
  }
  h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .lede {
    margin-top: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    max-width: 54ch;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }
  .lede p { font-size: var(--step-1); line-height: 1.5; }
  .lede .sub {
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .facts { margin-top: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); }
  dl {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(9.5rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--rule);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  dl > div { background: var(--paper); padding: 1rem 0.2rem 1.05rem; }
  dt {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  dd {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  dd span {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .jump { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .jump a {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
